        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Buddy MacKay, Lawton Chiles\n- Places: Florida\n- Roles: American politician, diplomat, United States Senator, Governor of Florida\n- Organizations: Democratic Party\n\nFacts:\n- Lawton Chiles was born on April 3, 1930, and he was an American politician from Florida.\n- Buddy MacKay was born on March 22, 1933, and he is an American politician and diplomat from Florida.\n- Lawton Chiles served as a United States Senator from 1971 to 1989.\n- Lawton Chiles served as the 41st Governor of Florida from 1991 to 1998.\n- Lawton Chiles died on December 12, 1998.\n- Buddy MacKay, a Democrat, briefly became the 42nd Governor of Florida after Lawton Chiles died on December 12, 1998.",
